  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120) from crops w01-320s1n/s2n/s3n (2022-06-22; the 2019-2020 crops show scaffolding). walls[0] the NE block's NW face (shell 1, 45.5 m): dark brick 0-15.6 m (6 bays in two triplets), dark brick 15.6-23.2 m (3 bays), red brick with pale strips beside the windows 23.2-45.5 m. walls[1] the SW block's NW face (shell 2, 68.3 m): dark brick 0-22.5 m (9 bays), buff brick with pale pilasters 22.5-45.1 m, dark purple-red 45.1-52.4 m (3 bays, lower) and 52.4-68.3 m (6 bays). The SE water side (balconies, set-back terraces; crop w02-140s1nL) is left to otherWalls in the dark red brick it shows."
